  "details": "What device are you using?\n\nIPhone 14\n\nWhat iOS version is installed?\n\n17.5.1\n\nWhat VRChat Build Number is installed? (You can find this in Testflight)\n\n2024.2.3 (333)\n\nWhat do you expected to happen?\n\nThe tag would show up as \"iOS\" or \"Apple\"\n\nWhat happens instead?\n\nThe tag shows up as \"Quest\"\n\nDo you have screenshots or other helpful media?\n\nYes\n\nThe platform tag shown on the nameplate shows up as \"Quest\" instead of one more fitting like \"iOS\" or \"Apple\". \n\nI got the image by going on an alt and taking a screenshot",
